fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gststructure.html#gst_structure_is_writable","fragment":"\n\tgst_structure_is_writable\n\n\n\tGst.Structure.prototype.is_writable\n\n\n\tGst.Structure.is_writable\n\nChecks if the structure is writable. TRUE if parent\nis not set or its refcount is 1, FALSE otherwise.\nParameters:\na GstStructure\nTRUE if the structure is writable.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nChecks if the structure is writable. true if parent\nis not set or its refcount is 1, false otherwise.\nParameters:\na Gst.Structure\ntrue if the structure is writable.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nChecks if the structure is writable. True if parent\nis not set or its refcount is 1, False otherwise.\nParameters:\na Gst.Structure\nTrue if the structure is writable.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});